[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4265948724","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4265948724","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4265948724,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-RTY0","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T06:37:35Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T06:38:22Z","body":"Thank you for working on this. Unfortunately, this PR currently breaks the drag selection box.\r\n\r\nAlso, until a way to show hover indicators can be devised for the 2D viewport, and transparency is better handled, this should be the way to go, IMO. Doesn't hurt to use context when possible.\r\n\r\nFirst | Then | Over What | Results In\r\n-- | -- | -- | --\r\nMouse Down | Mouse Up | Unselected | Select\r\nMouse Down | Mouse Up | Already selected | Select next overlapping / dive into children\r\nMouse Down | Mouse Up | Empty space | Clear selection\r\nMouse Down | Drag | Empty space | Drag Selection Box\r\nMouse Down | Drag | Already selected | Move selected\r\nMouse Down | Drag | Not selected, overlapping with selected | Move selected\r\nMouse Down | Drag | Not Selected, not overlapping with selected | Select this, then move\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4265948724/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266356189","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4266356189","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4266356189,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-S23d","user":{"login":"RainCmd","id":49861707,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODYxNzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49861707?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd","html_url":"https://github.com/RainCmd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T08:02:28Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T08:02:28Z","body":"You're correct.\r\nIn the current official implementation, the logic that should only happen on mouse up is being triggered immediately on mouse down, before the user releases the button.\r\nThis is effectively a bug in the existing interaction, and it’s the reason the drag selection box doesn’t work as expected.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266356189/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266603503","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4266603503","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4266603503,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-TzPv","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T08:47:21Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T08:47:21Z","body":"Thanks for opening a pull request!\r\n\r\nFeature pull requests should be associated to a feature proposal to justify the need for implementing the feature in Godot core. Please open a proposal on the [Godot proposals](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals) repository (and link to the proposal in this pull request's body). ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266603503/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266618750","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4266618750","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4266618750,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-T29-","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T08:50:12Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T08:55:30Z","body":"The visual shortcoming with the official implementation is the absence of a hover highlight, to show which item is destined for selection. So the act of selection cannot be 1. anticipation highlight on hover, 2. to-be selection highlight on mousedown, and 3. confirmed selection highlight on mouseup, the way it is for many design softwares. The practical shortcoming is a noticeable delay associated with confirming selection, so it all happening right away on mousedown seems to be the compromise.\r\n\r\nThis PR clearing selection on mousedown, and then reasserting it on mouseup - I'm not sure provides the best experience. Observe the inspector for this, especially when the selection is to stay the same. It might require the introduction intermediate state, like 2 described above.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266618750/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266701036","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4266701036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4266701036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-ULDs","user":{"login":"RainCmd","id":49861707,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODYxNzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49861707?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd","html_url":"https://github.com/RainCmd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T09:05:16Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T09:09:25Z","body":"One critical issue with the current \"select immediately on mouse down\" behavior is: when a child element fully covers its parent, you can never directly drag the parent element.\r\nBecause the mouse down instantly selects the child on top, you never get the chance to start a drag on the parent underneath.This is exactly why we need to defer the actual selection logic until mouse up.\r\n\r\nAlso, I’ve tested this PR thoroughly, and the inspector does NOT flicker at all when the selection remains the same.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266701036/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266729182","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4266729182","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4266729182,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-UR7e","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T09:10:09Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T09:10:09Z","body":"Also, do you have some data for this claim?\r\n> Many developers transitioning from Unity find Godot’s immediate selection on press unintuitive","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266729182/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266846505","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4266846505","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4266846505,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-Uukp","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T09:29:22Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T09:31:26Z","body":"> This is exactly why we need to defer the actual selection logic until mouse up.\r\n\r\nI agree with you on that, I'll share further thoughts on the proposal.\r\n\r\n> Also, I’ve tested this PR thoroughly, and the inspector does NOT flicker at all when the selection remains the same.\r\n\r\nI was mistaken, the inspector is cleared when mouse down happens on another item, when not in the \"cycle\" case. This is probably because of the drag box.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266846505/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4267137752","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4267137752","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4267137752,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-V1rY","user":{"login":"RainCmd","id":49861707,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODYxNzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49861707?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd","html_url":"https://github.com/RainCmd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T10:14:40Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T10:14:40Z","body":"> Also, do you have some data for this claim?\r\n> \r\n> > Many developers transitioning from Unity find Godot’s immediate selection on press unintuitive\r\n\r\nI apologize for the inaccurate wording earlier.I used AI assistance to draft the description, and upon further verification, I realize my statement about \"many developers\" was overstated.\r\nWhile there is community feedback that Godot’s immediate selection on mouse down feels unintuitive, especially compared to Unity’s behavior, it’s not appropriate to frame it as widespread or well-documented data.\r\nI’ll rely on actual usability issues instead—such as not being able to drag parent nodes covered by children—and avoid overgeneralizations moving forward. Thank you for catching this.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1469\" height=\"371\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b69b2348-d15b-424f-887c-ee7b2c1c500d\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2552\" height=\"1308\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5bca04ad-018f-43a9-b9af-0a9519c848a0\" />\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4267137752/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4267150726","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4267150726","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4267150726,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-V42G","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThous