//api.github.com/users/RainCmd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T11:43:35Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T11:43:35Z","body":"> > This is exactly why we need to defer the actual selection logic until mouse up.\r\n> \r\n> I agree with you on that, I'll share further thoughts on the proposal.\r\n> \r\n> > Also, I’ve tested this PR thoroughly, and the inspector does NOT flicker at all when the selection remains the same.\r\n> \r\n> I was mistaken, the inspector is cleared when mouse down happens on another item, when not in the \"cycle\" case. This is probably because of the drag box.\r\n\r\nI've updated the code to only clear the previous selection on mouse up now.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4267686239/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4268078930","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4268078930","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4268078930,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-ZbdS","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T12:45:50Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T13:17:56Z","body":"Tested, working, feels really great to use. Drag selection is also fixed. I still feel like the final case should be represented, though.\r\n\r\nMouse Down | Drag | Not Selected, not overlapping with selected | Select this, then move\r\n-- | -- | -- | --\r\n\r\nTo clarify, by this I mean if the cursor is not overlapping with selected, we should try to find something else to drag if we can, basically same as it was before.\r\n\r\nWorth noting:\r\nDouble clicking an item that is an instance of a saved scene will open that scene in a new tab. This may interfere with the flow of click click click to cycle through items.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4268078930/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4268708296","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4268708296","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4268708296,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-b1HI","user":{"login":"RainCmd","id":49861707,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODYxNzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49861707?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd","html_url":"https://github.com/RainCmd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T14:04:11Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T14:04:11Z","body":"I think it makes more sense to select an item first before dragging it, which helps prevent accidental drags.\r\nSince UI elements often cover large areas of the scene, the original marquee selection was a bit cumbersome. You either had to start dragging from a completely empty spot with no items underneath, or hold down Shift to begin marquee selection.Allowing marquee selection when not overlapping the current selection makes the workflow much smoother.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4268708296/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4268794457","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4268794457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4268794457,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-cKJZ","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T14:12:33Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T14:47:13Z","body":"I agree, but having this case more sensitive to transparency would solve this, correct? So that when something looks like \"nothing\" it is treated like nothing rather than an \"invisible something\" when dragged, in the case that it is also unselected. Then, if so far zoomed in into something eg. a colored rect that it may as well be the canvas, we can consider that \"nothing\" as well.\r\n\r\nUnless that distinction can be made, either now or in a follow-up PR, I think keeping this case is important, as its removal would disrupt current users quite a bit.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4268794457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4268853540","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118660#issuecomment-4268853540","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118660","id":4268853540,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-cYkk","user":{"login":"RainCmd","id":49861707,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODYxNzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49861707?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd","html_url":"https://github.com/RainCmd","follo